103	    /**
104	     * Inclusive 4-digit postcode range {@code {low, high}} per region, the fixed ground truth for
105	     * validating an owner's postcode against the region derived from its city. A region not listed
106	     * here (e.g. the {@code "UNKNOWN"} locality of an unmapped city) imposes no range constraint, so
107	     * any 4-digit postcode is accepted.
